WEBVTT

00:28.898 --> 00:32.560
The wind has drove beyond the tree

00:35.829 --> 00:39.693
A sudden calm upon the seas

00:42.696 --> 00:46.419
We watched the lightning strike the ground

00:49.542 --> 00:53.646
But now there is no other sound

00:56.609 --> 01:00.433
The broken glass is swept away

01:03.473 --> 01:11.935
To leave us in the light of day And we are walking

01:12.155 --> 01:14.796
in the silent storm

01:18.137 --> 01:22.478
Waiting for the weather to keep us warm

01:24.999 --> 01:31.270
The empty space is just a shape we leave behind A

01:31.370 --> 01:36.232
quiet place for us to finally find

01:38.912 --> 01:43.754
In the silent storm

01:56.618 --> 02:00.439
You fold the papers, close the door

02:03.795 --> 02:07.917
We don't need answers anymore

02:10.859 --> 02:14.721
The Orchestra has gone to sleep

02:17.863 --> 02:22.326
And gave us promises to keep

02:25.068 --> 02:28.990
We crossed the ocean in the dark

02:32.148 --> 02:38.134
To rescue one remaining spar

02:38.394 --> 02:43.359
And we are walking in the silent storm

02:46.643 --> 02:51.227
Waiting for the wear to keep us warm

02:53.546 --> 02:59.812
The empty space is just a shape we leave behind A

02:59.912 --> 03:05.777
quiet place for us to finally find

03:07.579 --> 03:11.522
In the silent storm

03:25.453 --> 03:33.988
The true light blinks, it always gleams We wake

03:34.128 --> 03:35.671
up from the shattered dreams

03:51.032 --> 03:52.713
a a a

04:38.678 --> 04:40.721
The silent storm

